# Byte-identical checkouts on every platform.
#
# Twelve scripts hash file bytes rather than git blob contents, among them
# validate_calling_contract_pin.py, generate_release_manifest.py and
# generate_source_sbom.py. Without this file a Windows clone applies
# core.autocrlf and rewrites line endings on checkout, so those digests differ
# from the ones Linux CI computes and the gates fail on a tree that is actually
# correct. No file content changes: every tracked file is already stored LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary payloads.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.xls  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ods  binary
